      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S A PEARL (1) is a well performed dog and winner of 18 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at this track (30.26). Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Looks the one to beat on his best form. INDY MELMEN (4) missed the frame last time when sixth (30.52) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. HAPPY DAD (2) was in winning form two back (27.15) at Horsham but ran below best last time at this track, finishing 7th. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Expected to give a good account. POINT BREAK (7) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
